{"sourceUrl":"https://yxy.muc.edu.cn/info/1017/13049.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:55:11.824550+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://yxy.muc.edu.cn/info/1017/13049.htm","html":"<div><div>\n<p><span>一、学院简介</span></p><p><span>中央民族大学中药学学科聚焦中医药现代化和健康中国国家战略，发挥多学科交叉融合优势，深化产教研协同创新，不断推进学科内涵式高质量发展。本学科所在药学院已建成民族医药文化学北京市重点交叉学科、民族医药教育部重点实验室、中国少数民族传统医学教育部创新团队和民族医药研究国家民委创新团队。</span></p><p><span><span>学院获国务院政府特殊津贴专家</span><span>2</span><span>人、新世纪百千万人才工程国家级人选</span><span>2</span><span>人、国家“万人计划”科技创新领军人才</span><span>1</span><span>人、北京市教学名师</span><span>1</span><span>人、教育部新世纪优秀人才</span><span>1</span><span>人、北京市科技新星计划</span><span>2</span><span>人、宝钢优秀教师奖</span><span>2</span><span>人、国家民委领军人才支持计划</span><span>1</span><span>人、科技部中青年科技创新领军人才</span><span>1</span><span>人、国家民委中青年英才</span><span>1</span><span>人、中央民族大学“杰出育人奖”</span><span>1</span><span>人，形成了一支结构合理的教师队伍和高层次的学术研究梯队。</span></span></p><p><span><span>近五年，主持及承担国家级、省部级等各类科研课题</span><span>30</span><span>余项，其中国家重点研发计划项目</span><span>2</span><span>项，国家重点研发计划课题</span><span>2</span><span>项，课题任务</span><span>1</span><span>项；国家自然科学基金</span></span><span><span>重点项目</span><span>1</span><span>项，</span></span><span><span>国家重大科研仪器研制项目</span><span>1</span><span>项；国家自然科学基金</span></span><span>区域联合重点项目、面上项目和青年</span><span>项目</span><span><span>等</span><span>12</span></span><span>项；</span><span><span>北京市自然科学基金区域联合重点项目</span><span>1</span><span>项</span></span><span><span>。累计到账科研经费</span><span>4000</span><span>余万元。发表学术论文</span><span>220</span><span>余篇，申请及授权专利</span></span><span><span>10</span></span><span>余项。</span></p><p><span>二、</span><span>拟招生专业及人数</span></p><p><span><span>（一）</span><span>100800</span><span>中药学（学硕）；</span><span>1005600</span><span>中药（专硕）</span></span></p><p><span>（二）接收名额</span></p><p><span><span>1.</span><span>中药学（学硕）和中药（专硕）接收推荐免试硕士研究生名额由学校研究生院统一公布。</span></span></p><p><span><span>2.</span><span>我校士兵计划不接收推荐免试硕士研究生。</span></span></p><p><span>三、申请条件</span></p><p><span><span>申请人应符合《中央民族大学关于</span><span>2027</span><span>年接收推荐免试研究生（含直博生）预报名的通知》中的申请要求。</span></span></p><p><span>四、接收程序</span></p><p><strong><span><span>（一）</span></span></strong><strong><span>申请人报名。</span></strong><span>请</span><span><span>申请人</span></span><span>于</span><span><span>2026</span><span>年</span><span>8</span><span>月</span><span>1</span><span>日—</span><span>8</span><span>月</span><span>21</span><span>日，</span></span><span><span>登录中央民族大学研究生招生平台系统（</span>https://yjszs.muc.edu.cn<span>）进行报名，并按要求提交报名材料。</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>（二）</span></span></strong><strong><span>公布进入复试名单。</span></strong><span><span>学院考核组将</span></span><span>对申请者的申请资格和报名材料进行审核</span><span>并</span><span><span>择优</span></span><span>确定进入复试名单</span><span><span>。</span></span><span>不符合条件者不</span><span><span>进行审核</span></span><span>。</span><span><span>复试名单将于</span><span>8</span><span>月</span><span>24</span><span>日在学院网站</span></span><span><span>（</span>https://yxy.muc.edu.cn/<span>）</span></span><span>进行公布。</span></p><p><strong><span><span>（三）</span></span></strong><strong><span>组织复试。</span></strong><span><span>学院将在</span></span><span><span>8</span><span>月</span><span>31</span><span>日—</span><span>9</span><span>月</span><span>1</span><span>日</span></span><span><span>组织复试考核。复试结束，</span></span><span><span>学院核查成绩无误后于</span><span>9</span><span>月</span><span>2</span><span>日</span></span><span><span>后通过学院网站</span></span><span><span>（</span></span><span>https://yxy.muc.edu.cn/</span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>向考生公示复试成绩，公示期为</span>3<span>天。</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>（</span></span></strong><strong><span>四</span></strong><strong><span><span>）</span></span></strong><strong><span>教育部推免系统报名及确认。</span></strong><span><span>根据教育部规定，推免生正式报名和录取工作须通过</span><span>“</span><span>全国推荐免试攻读研究生（免初试、转段）信息公开管理服务系统</span><span>”</span><span>（简称</span><span>“</span><span>教育部推免服务系统</span><span>”</span><span>）进行。待</span><span>“</span><span>教育部推免服务系统</span><span>”</span><span>开通后，取得所在学校推荐免试资格的申请者须在</span><span>“</span><span>教育部推免服务系统</span><span>”</span><span>中填报中央民族大学。我校将根据</span></span><span>复试合格考生的</span><span><span>复试</span></span><span>总</span><span><span>成绩从高到低择优进行拟录取。申请者须在规定时间内按照相关程序接收复试通知、待录取通知</span></span><span>。</span><span><span>否则视为放弃中央民族大学接收资格。</span></span><span>“</span><span><span>教育部推免服务系统</span></span><span>”</span><span><span>的开通时间以教育部通知为准。</span></span></p><p><span>如申请人最终未取得所在学校推荐免试资格，复试成绩无效，不予拟录取。</span></p><p><span>五、报名材料要求</span></p><p><span><span>申请人须在</span></span><span>报名时间内通过</span><span><span>报名</span></span><span>系统</span><span><span>提交如下材料</span></span><span>，</span><span>报名系统关闭后将无法提交，请申请人及时完成报名和材料上传。</span></p><p><span>（一）</span><span><span>身份证复印件扫描版（正反面扫描在</span>1<span>页纸上）</span></span></p><p><span>（二）</span><span>《教育部学籍在线验证报告》（学信网下载）</span><span><span>。</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span></span><span>三</span><span><span>）《中央民族大学</span>202</span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>年接收推荐免试研究生申请表》（从</span></span><span>我校推免系统下载后打印，由申请人所在学院或教务部门盖章</span><span><span>）。</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span></span><span>四</span><span><span>）本科第</span>1-5<span>学期成绩单（</span></span><span>须加</span><span><span>盖</span></span><span>本科就读</span><span><span>学校教务处或所在学院公章）。</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span></span><span>五</span><span><span>）外语水平证明复印件。</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span></span><span>六</span><span><span>）能够体现自身学术水平、科研能力、综合素质的学术科研成果、获奖证书等材料。</span></span></p><p><span><span>注：申请人须将所有材料按照顺序整合为一个</span>PDF<span>文档并制作目录。申请人提交的材料应保证其真实性，申请材料不全或不按要求</span></span><span>提交</span><span><span>，将不予受理。最终电子材料以最后一次上传为准，如上传错误重传后即可覆盖之前上传的材料。</span></span></p><p><span>六、资格复审</span></p><p><span><span>在复试工作开展前</span></span><span>，学院</span><span><span>将对申请者资格进行复审，重点审核外国语成绩、本科期间成绩、应届生的学籍验证报告、申请表盖章情况、推荐信等</span></span><span>。</span><span><span>不符合申请条件者不允许参加复试，已经参加复试者取消复试成绩</span></span><span>。</span></p><p><span>七</span><span>、</span><span>关于复试</span></p><p><span>（一）复试形式：综合面试</span></p><p><span>（二）复试内容：思想政治审核、知识结构、专业基础知识、综合分析及科研创新能力及潜力等，外国语听说能力考核在综合面试中进行。</span></p><p><span>（三）复试安排</span><span>：</span></p><p><span><span>1.</span><span>报到并进行材料审核：</span><span>8</span><span>月</span><span>31</span><span>日</span><span>14:30</span><span>报到，中央民族大学海淀校区</span><span>1</span><span>号办公楼</span><span>204</span><span>会议室，提交个人材料（原件），由专人对申请资格进行审核；</span></span></p><p><span><span>2.9</span><span>月</span><span>1</span><span>日全天复试，具体安排如下：</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span><span>1</span><span>）中药学（</span><span>100800</span><span>）学术型硕士研究生</span></span></p><p><span><span>综合面试时间：</span><span>9</span><span>月</span><span>1</span><span>日全天</span></span></p><p><span><span>上午：</span><span>8</span><span>：</span><span>30</span><span>—</span><span>12</span><span>：</span><span>00</span></span></p><p><span><span>下午：</span><span>13</span><span>：</span><span>30</span><span>—</span><span>18</span><span>：</span><span>30</span></span></p><p><span><span>综合面试地点：</span><span>1</span><span>号办公楼</span><span>204</span><span>会议室</span></span></p><p><span><span>备注：所有复试考生</span><span>7</span><span>：</span><span>50</span><span>到待考区</span><a href=\"https://yxy.muc.edu.cn/info/1017/13049.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><span>（</span><span>1</span><span>号办公楼</span><span>304</span><span>教室）</span><span>集中报到。</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span><span>2</span><span>）中药（</span><span>105600</span><span>）专业硕士统招考生</span></span></p><p><span><span>综合面试时间：</span><span>9</span><span>月</span><span>1</span><span>日全天</span></span></p><p><span><span>上午：</span><span>8</span><span>：</span><span>30</span><span>—</span><span>12</span><span>：</span><span>00</span></span></p><p><span><span>下午：</span><span>13</span><span>：</span><span>30</span><span>—</span><span>18</span><span>：</span><span>30</span></span></p><p><span><span>综合面试地点：</span><span>1</span><span>号办公楼</span><span>216</span><span>会议室</span></span></p><p><span><span>备注：所有复试考生</span><span>7</span><span>：</span><span>50</span><span>前到待考区（</span><span>1</span><span>号办公楼</span><span>304</span><span>教室）集中报到。</span></span></p><p><span>※复试方式、时间、地点如有变动，届时将单独通知考生。</span></p><p><span><span>4.</span><span>复试要求：每位考生综合面试时间为</span><span>20</span><span>分钟。面试时，考生可携带简历</span><span>7</span><span>份，供复试组专家参考。</span></span></p><p><span><span>5.</span><span>复试成绩计算：复试成绩即为最终成绩，复试成绩低于</span><span>60</span><span>分不予录取，最终成绩按照复试成绩从高到低排序，拟录取名单由学校研究生院统一公示。</span></span></p><p><span><span>复试成绩（以百分制）</span><span>=</span><span>综合面试成绩</span><span>*100%</span></span></p><p><span>八</span><span>、注意事项与其他说明</span></p><p><span>1.<span>申请人必须如实、准确提交申请材料。凡推免过程中弄虚作假，或存在学术不端行为，或入学前受到处分的申请人，一经查实，即取消其录取资格，已入学的取消其学籍。</span></span></p><p><span><span>2.</span><span>已经被录取的推免生必须在录取当年学校规定的入学报到日前取得国家承认的本科毕业证书，否则取消其录取资格。</span></span></p><p><span><span>3</span></span><span>.<span>我校接收的推荐免试研究生均为</span></span><span>非定向、</span><span><span>全日制</span></span><span>。中药学（</span><span><span>学硕）基本学制为</span><span>3</span><span>年，中药（专硕）基本学制为</span><span>3</span><span>年</span></span><span>。</span></p><p><span><span>4</span></span><span>.</span><span>本通知</span><span><span>未尽事宜或内容与后续</span></span><span>教育部</span><span><span>和学校有关文件不一致的，依照教育部和我校相关规定执行。</span></span></p><p><span><span>5</span></span><span>.</span><span><span>根据北京市发改委、北京市财政局《关于部分高等教育招生考试收费标准的函》，考生需要缴纳复试费，标准为</span><span>100</span><span>元</span><span>/</span><span>考生。</span></span></p><p><span>九、咨询方式</span></p><p><span><span>招生咨询电话：</span></span><span><span>（</span><span>010</span><span>）</span><span>68939942 (</span><span>何老师</span><span>)</span></span></p><p><span>招生邮箱</span><span><span>：</span></span> <span>mucyaoxueyuan@126.com</span></p><p><span><span>本方案最终解释权归中央民族大学</span></span><span>药</span><span><span>学院所有。</span></span> </p><p><br/></p><p><br/></p><p><span>药</span><span><span>学院</span></span></p><p><span><span>2026</span><span>年</span><span>7</span><span>月</span><span>21</span><span>日</span></span></p><p><br/></p>\n</div></div>","textSha256":"2415faa0f82926d62946cd7a635346920cb2fce9fa7c475712d1817a751a244b","textLength":2666,"sourceSha256":"f544f00836954a52e0393646e0c2cd20d121b9c6aaa99160ac9cb985a4bb2b5c","selector":"#vsb_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-78a320b613dc47d4810b","title":"2026年中央民族大学药学院关于2027年接收推荐免试研究生预报名的通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:55:11.824550+00:00"}
